60 min\n21:30\n£99.00\n60 min\n07:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n08:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n09:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n10:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n11:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n12:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n13:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n14:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n15:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n16:30\nBooked\n60 min\n17:30\nBooked\n60 min\n18:30\n£99.00\n60 min\n19:30\n£99.00\n60 min\n20:30\n£99.00\n60 min\n21:30\n£99.00\n60 min\n07:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n08:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n09:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n10:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n11:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n12:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n13:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n14:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n15:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n16:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n17:30\nBooked\n60 min\n18:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n19:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n20:30\n£90.00\n60 min\n21:30\n£90.00\n60 min\nLocation, Opening Hours and Prices\n Click to interact with the map\n\n 31–33 Pursley Road, Mill Hill, Barnet, NW7 2BB\n\nPrices\n\nFrom £64.95-£129.00/hour\n\nPublic Transport\n\n Mill Hill East\n\nOpening Hours\nMonday\t09:30-22:30\nTuesday\t09:30-22:30\nWednesday\t09:30-22:30\nThursday\t09:30-22:30\nFriday\t09:30-22:30\nSaturday\t09:30-16:30\nSunday\t09:30-22:30\nDescription\n\nLooking to hire a 5-a-side football pitch in north London? Powerleague Mill Hill is perfect for lovers of the small-sided version of the beautiful game. 5-a-side football at Powerleague Mill Hill is played on 3G astroturf. So whether you're looking for a casual kick about with your friends or whether you're part of a team that is a cohesive 5-a-side football machine, Powerleague Mill Hill is the right choice for you.\n\nThe venue is surrounded by floodlights which makes this facility perfect all year around. The lights will be turned off by the facility once all sports bookings have been completed.\n\nIf you’re travelling by car, then you’ll be glad to know there is free parking provided by the venue. The free parking at the facility can fill up at peak times and get busy, with weekends being a very popular time, so allow ample time to ensure you secure a space. Customers will be pleased to know that the venue operates a pay-as-you-play booking system. This means sports enthusiasts can just turn up and play depending on availability and book on a pay as you play basis. This method avoids the monthly membership charges and gives you the freedom to play as and when you like, without the commitment of a weekly game or a membership fee.\n\nIf a one-off game isn't enough, then why not take advantage of the block booking option at Powerleague Mill Hill? Block bookings are a great way to guarantee a weekly game and socialise with your friends. It also takes the hassle out of paying before each game and collecting money from teammates as there is a one-time payment. The changing rooms on offer here are excellent. Well maintained and spacious changing rooms provide the perfect environment in which to prepare for your match. The venue's changing rooms provide toilets and also a communal changing area. The well-equipped changing rooms provide an additional excellence to this already outstanding sports facility.\n\nThe closest station when travelling is Mill Hill East. The facility is located a short walk from here - for more details on how to access the facility please contact the venue.\n\n Football Pitches\n5 a side | 3G Astroturf7 a side | 3G Astroturf9 a side | 3G Astroturf\nFacilities\n floodlights changing rooms free parking\n Address\n\nPowerleague Mill Hill\n31–33 Pursley Road\nMill Hill\nNW7 2BB\n\n\nVIEW ON MAP\nREVEAL PHONE NUMBER\nMAKE A BOOKING\n Nearby Football Pitches\nMallinson Sports Centre\nHighgate\n\n 3.7 miles away\n\nHenry Fawcett Primary School\nLondon\n\n 9.8 miles away\n\nLifestyle Fitness Epsom\nEpsom\n\n 17 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 20.6 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 20.6 miles away\n\n",
